{"version":1,"key":"article:73","content":{"id":73,"title":"JavaScript 函数中 this 的指向","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"17843252-f78a-4538-bb8c-90cdd5572035","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示函数执行时调用该函数的对象，因此函数中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和调用方式有关，而不是和定义的地方有关，不同的调用方式函数内部的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也不一样，所以要搞明白函数内部 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值，就得看有哪些调用函数的方式："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"344b20f1-c2f9-47ec-a26f-671cafdea9ad","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fe8db7b5-461f-4a50-9da4-b2eacbd9f2ad","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1c3ba7a0-6f3b-4ca4-af4e-65ed49106773","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直接调用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4b7a79bd-18f1-43d6-889b-21f253d5db43","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9171072b-9f3b-4439-8bb8-3b227613d976","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对象调用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1ccc78c5-e03d-43f3-b109-ed55ae213582","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ab95e4c-6ff5-47c5-af96-bb2893d00764","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"构造函数"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b4db5c37-0586-46c9-afa0-8e08f032f782","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bb8a4b1f-4ee4-44f8-a28f-ff257e8585dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"bind"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"call"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"apply"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b795585-34d5-4d97-90fc-73e0e1a908fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有一特殊的函数，箭头函数，它内部并不存在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，导致它需要从作用域链中访问 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是说它内部的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和调用方式无关，而是和定义函数所处的作用域有关。"}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"cede100b-acd5-48d5-b77e-027aca4039ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直接调用"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6de00ea-73b9-4268-a071-807850f141f8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数直接调用，分为两种情况："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"bc2b7b53-7630-4844-a994-09a2d1df6798","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a9502316-afa2-4525-aa2c-10d9f720c054","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"36d7238c-ffe3-4263-a17e-b56a6aeb0526","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"非严格模式：指向 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"c60987e6-f9b5-4a66-8b17-99cd87585086","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ff11dec4-455f-4bb0-b81e-a82345a8ab86","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"window.a = 1;\nfunction hello() {\n  console.log(this === window, this.a)\n}\n\nhello(); // true 1","collabId":"36ab4d43-eb03-472a-b56f-7472fcecf438","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1254215b-5be5-47d5-8c49-7d29425419b8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7aca73f2-ad9e-419e-bd2c-9f65ba18b883","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"严格模式：指向 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"002abea7-f821-44b8-ae1a-b6e75745c395","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"af3b2c3f-c404-4afa-ac2a-01ef977067a1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"\"use strict\"\nwindow.a = 1;\nfunction hello() {\n  console.log(this === undefined)\n}\n\nhello(); // true","collabId":"68df9340-0a81-417f-8bda-9ee3ecc9d375","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"961f8ac1-3b46-4e45-91bd-9e05abd2ee8b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对象调用"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f340eeea-eb01-4d32-a5a7-cddc52be9931","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过对象去调用函数（也称为方法）的时候，函数中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指向调用该对象本身"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b6704c3b-e521-411a-bc2c-9e782323fe66","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6dcb99ed-f195-4c1f-8db7-34614b2c6929","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n  a: 1,\n  hello: function () {\n    console.log(this === obj, this.a)\n  }\n}\nobj.hello(); // true 1","collabId":"c3cbf148-4bd3-4ac6-9a0c-3ac3237adf58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"24e257ce-32dc-4971-a7b5-35e0fa8e5e93","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果函数定义在对象中，但是通过赋值给其他变量，然后直接调用，此时函数中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指向的不是该对象，而是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"因为 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":" 与调用方式有关，和定义在哪里无关"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"876d8e24-fa9c-460d-8b2a-f6b8443ce06e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"25292aee-861c-4725-b376-aa965aaffffc","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n  a: 1,\n  hello: function () {\n    console.log(this === obj, this.a)\n  }\n}\n\nconst hello = obj.hello;\n\nhello(); // false undefined","collabId":"5e29d012-ccff-45b2-8833-b4051ca14c97","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"1c9b26dd-96a8-4398-8c77-9392d1040cd8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"构造函数"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"376fed91-300b-4e46-bab7-5780895ca50a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数的一个作用就是作为模板创建一个对象，这种函数也叫做构造函数，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"new"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的方式来调用。对于构造函数，其中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指向的是被构造的对象，因此可以通过对 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行赋值来对构建对象进行初始化，构造函数不用手动返回值，会自动将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"154eed1e-2fbd-40a9-aa12-fd5503763e36","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9ce7e594-5c21-48bf-ba14-64ea0e82820b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function Person(name, age) {\n  console.log(this instanceof Person); // true\n  this.name = name;\n  this.age = age;\n}\n\nconst person = new Person('张三', 18);\nconsole.log(person); // { name: '张三', age: 18 }","collabId":"ddccd7a2-eaac-4f8a-b4a4-829c9661b0bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"2974d596-76e6-42cc-8f4e-b2c951482e2d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e1f824ad-1789-49a6-a21a-307b450a8878","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"构建函数在没有返回值的情况下或返回值不是对象的情况下，将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作为创建的对象返回，如上所示，但是如果构建的返回值是一个对象的话，那么返回的是这个对象而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ea9108d9-f612-453f-88ef-ca7a18197748","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9223dc21-167a-4ff0-a824-9845ba36cb79","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function Person(name, age) {\n  console.log(this instanceof Person); // true\n  this.name = name;\n  this.age = age;\n\n  return {\n    a: 1\n  }\n}\n\nconst person = new Person('张三', 18);\nconsole.log(person); // { a: 1 }","collabId":"df86a1ff-e610-4eca-888d-1d3e0710b97d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"5e525b07-b9a9-4518-a4f6-e9960413188c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"bind、call、apply"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"663582db-ce45-42c0-9a6f-32f7270476a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"bind"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"call"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"apply"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是三个函数，这三个函数的作用是改变函数的内部的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指向。它定义在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Function.prototype"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上，因此每个函数上都有这三个函数。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15128c0a-1b40-4ac7-95db-234b978d09bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这三个函数分为两类："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f6639e8d-0bd6-4544-8396-7aeab1fb3639","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ab8158f2-f4dc-44cb-90c5-e201efc7001c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3bfed43a-b7c6-473e-8329-a022c6bcbfe0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"bind"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，第一个参数用来指定函数内部的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"返回一个新函数"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，一旦指定 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后，函数内部的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就固定了，和调用方式无关"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f8096171-61af-4ae8-8bde-e8325c1ad479","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3a66c8db-3a22-474d-bed3-e50d86d5d4f4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj1 = {\n  a: 1\n}\nconst obj2 = {\n  a: 2\n}\nconst obj3 = {\n  a: 3,\n  hello: function () {\n    console.log(this.a)\n  }\n}\n\nobj3.hello(); // 3\n\nconst bindHello1 = obj3.hello.bind(obj1);\nbindHello1(); // 1\n\nconst bindHello2 = obj3.hello.bind(obj2);\nbindHello2(); // 2","collabId":"ffa69fea-64d7-4f7c-b1f5-54c7709666a0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7bf1dd72-2f3c-459e-b397-6363153be018","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"bind"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一次后，后续在进行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"bind"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 无用，以第一次 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"bind"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 值为准"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"5ea4367f-64ed-41f4-a745-ff64df800618","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"681b2692-012c-441a-bcd2-102edbf65c7b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const bindHello1 = obj3.hello.bind(obj1);\nconst bindHello2 = bindHello1.bind(obj2);\n\nbindHello2(); // 1","collabId":"9726df90-c71d-488e-9d50-a13f9c6588f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e2b8f3a1-477b-4532-9116-d54a35e43a4f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5f989c3a-5fb3-400c-a53d-b7eadad33524","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"apply"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"call"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，同样接收参数用来指定函数内部的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"并且立即执行"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，二者不同之处在于传递参数的方式不同，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"apply"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 通过数组传递函数参数，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"call"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 通过展开的方式传递函数参数"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"fb5e0be7-d733-4ab0-92a2-b070695537b1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ca0f2ffa-9bed-487e-a143-b5d08a07ee23","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj1 = {\n  a: 1\n}\nconst obj2 = {\n  a: 2\n}\nconst obj3 = {\n  a: 3,\n  hello: function (num) {\n    console.log(num + this.a)\n  }\n}\n\nobj3.hello(2); // 2 + 3 => 5\n\n//  将参数 2 传递给 hello，将传递的参数形成一个数组传递\nobj3.hello.apply(obj1, [2]); // 2 + 1 => 3\n\n// 将参数 2 传递给 hello，和正常调用 hello 一样传递参数\nobj3.hello.call(obj2, 2); // 2 + 2 => 4","collabId":"4ba0970e-0c44-4a72-83ff-b54f528d8c6a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"9490d485-421f-4f60-8f23-461bc3d0b67d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"箭头函数"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"925d3786-9e78-4317-86da-a077b1c68eaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"箭头函数是 ES6 提出一种创建函数的语法糖，除了可以方便的创建函数外，还具有很多和一般函数不同的特性："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"10b57bc7-dc4d-4f74-8a50-9ec08c27827f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7183664e-8032-4f9f-b604-dd84e6bae4ef","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4d31a127-db77-4153-8cd0-cdf0569f251f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"没有原型属性"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"aba11e15-18d0-45f6-b483-008399326373","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b8b4b9c1-7924-4c7e-b3bd-0d59c562993e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"没有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，没有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"da187e40-f5ce-4654-a582-79679d53ba37","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e5015198-26fb-46b2-ac44-1b9d56aaa52b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不能作为构造函数，即无法通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"new"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 调用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fd5f5e86-21d2-4ca4-9c05-72ea48c1a756","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"703a78b8-f7a5-4351-991a-06e18ae2dd8f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不能作为生成器"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7716870f-597e-4d1a-ab84-98bece26215f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里我们关注箭头函数内部没有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那当我们在箭头函数里面访问 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的时候，会发生什么呢？想想我们在函数中访问一个不存在的变量时会发生什么，因为当前作用域中不存在该变量，它会沿着作用域链继续往上查找，直到找到变量，如果没有，则报错。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也是同样，因为箭头函数中不存在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么它就会沿着作用域链往上寻找，这就意味着箭头函数的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和调用方式无关，而是和函数定义时所处的作用域中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有关。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"7180c2b8-ca66-4241-8405-eb01c9ae372a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7430ca43-2c39-4c21-b630-38e0aefcf038","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n  a: 1,\n  hello: () => {\n    console.log(this.a);\n  }\n}\n\nobj.hello(); // undefined","collabId":"23ec665a-04cc-4c40-80c5-dd61ac13124c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dedb124f-013b-455f-a2c2-0895cc0fbb6b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"hello"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并不是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为是箭头函数，所以里面的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是定义时所处作用域链中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this.a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"1e20578e-c3d0-4721-8605-334e0251ce03","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d98f66f5-a750-4714-a4b2-379640879b26","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function Person(name) {\n  this.name = name;\n\n  return {\n    getName: () => {\n      return this.name;\n    },\n  }\n}\n\nconst person = new Person('Tom');\nconsole.log(person.getName()); // Tom\n\nconst getName = person.getName;\nconsole.log(getName()); // Tom\n\nconsole.log(getName.bind(obj)()); // Tom\nconsole.log(getName.call(obj)); // Tom\nconsole.log(getName.apply(obj)); // Tom","collabId":"4b27564f-2bab-4cb2-854b-0e82cb6a2f77","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fbd7b024-836f-46fd-826b-0ef6001b7d40","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述不管通过什么样的方式调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getName"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getName"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 内部的函数始终指向 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"new Person()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时产生的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以访问 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this.name"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时始终是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Tom"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a9f03825-419b-4ab0-a9d6-f24e5647a285","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"4dd8050f-db7c-4595-a27a-966d06527323","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"84acf29f-3be1-4e0f-a3c9-4ef99a3ae973","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d52d398e-432c-4e58-b4d9-69f09a4bd7d6","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/this","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"5fab82ff-02ed-4ef7-b3ab-05bd84972e52","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"this"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","